; lake_well.room - O Poco (design 04 section 3.5). Espacial 2 (design 02 section 8): Redoma at the bank's edge (col 15, floor row 6)
; dries the well (cols 16-18) and the flooded passage (cols 14-16, rows 9-10) under the sealed chamber; Ivo goes up its hole (col 14)
; into the chamber, whose trapped air keeps it dry (bugs/well-water-stands-in-the-air-at-a-passage-mouth).
; The way in and out is the hatch (col 9) over the catch ledge (row 3), linked to the fishing village's stairwell (WORLD-29).
; Logico 1: a squall (x 64-480, y 96-288) sweeps chamber and bank; Redoma in the chamber shelters a Soltar that drops the curtain (col 2).

